WEBVTT

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:33.360
"Let's do something
about human rights abuses in China."

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.176
And his boss had replied,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.896
"We can't do anything
about human rights abuses in China

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.520
because we have
trade relations with China."

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.256
So my friend went away
with his tail between his legs,

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.440
and six months later,
he returned again to his boss,

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.856
and he said this time,

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.376
"Let's do something
about human rights in Burma,"

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.600
as it was then called.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.536
His boss once again paused

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.576
and said, "Oh, but we can't
do anything about human rights in Burma